That's why I want her to build up her
confidence until she has the will to ask

230
00:18:19,410 --> 00:18:21,746
him out on her own.

231
00:18:25,291 --> 00:18:30,171
Wouldn't it suck? When you're both
supposed to like each other, and one

232
00:18:30,255 --> 00:18:35,135
person thinks the other is
just with them out of pity.

233
00:18:36,553 --> 00:18:37,387
Yeah.

234
00:18:38,888 --> 00:18:42,475
I guess if you think about it, even if
we did end up telling Sawako that Kazehaya

235
00:18:42,559 --> 00:18:46,146
likes her, I'm pretty sure
she'd never believe us anyway.

236
00:18:46,229 --> 00:18:49,816
They're being so
considerate of my feelings.

237
00:18:49,899 --> 00:18:51,401
That's true.

238
00:18:55,238 --> 00:18:59,033
But that doesn't change
what I said... yesterday.

239
00:19:01,286 --> 00:19:05,748
Oh, if we're talking about Sawako... Well,
of course you don't understand her in that

240
00:19:05,832 --> 00:19:10,336
aspect, you might be
the furthest from her.

241
00:19:12,297 --> 00:19:15,717
The one who didn't understand... was me!

242
00:19:15,800 --> 00:19:19,762
So anyway, you were saying
something about him yesterday?

243
00:19:20,054 --> 00:19:24,267
A-About who? I didn't say anything
about Kazehaya-who? I mean, what?

244
00:19:24,350 --> 00:19:29,731
Crap! I gotta do something about
this fast or Yano-chin's gonna kill me!

245
00:19:29,814 --> 00:19:33,067
You went to the cursed lecture?

246
00:19:33,151 --> 00:19:34,485
How was it?

247
00:19:34,569 --> 00:19:35,987
It was insane, dude!

248
00:19:36,070 --> 00:19:38,489
Uh-huh! The rumors were true!

249
00:19:38,573 --> 00:19:42,160
If I were to give an example... let me see...
It's kinda like losing 5 kilos within 3

250
00:19:42,243 --> 00:19:46,206
- days! Yeah, like that!
- S-Say what?!

251
00:19:48,208 --> 00:19:50,793
Th- That sounds like
some kind of disease! Oh no!

252
00:19:50,877 --> 00:19:53,338
Sadako's amazing, huh?!

253
00:19:55,215 --> 00:19:59,928
- Hey they're complimenting you!
- Sada...

254
00:20:11,814 --> 00:20:12,815
Awesome!

255
00:20:13,399 --> 00:20:16,110
You're seriously incredible, Sadako!

256
00:20:17,904 --> 00:20:20,031
- Can you do it again?
- Can I get a passing score in 3 days too?

257
00:20:20,114 --> 00:20:21,866
I want in too!

258
00:20:22,242 --> 00:20:23,243
You see?

259
00:20:23,576 --> 00:20:27,580
Have some more faith in yourself.

260
00:20:29,040 --> 00:20:29,874
Hey, Sadako.

261
00:20:30,667 --> 00:20:34,295
- Thanks so much for yesterday.
- No! It was my pleasure!

262
00:20:37,298 --> 00:20:40,551
By the way, I was wondering, that plant
you gave me the other day where'd you get

263
00:20:40,635 --> 00:20:43,721
- it?
- That was a medicinal herb that

264
00:20:43,805 --> 00:20:45,556
- I'm growing in the flower beds.
- Seriously?

265
00:20:45,640 --> 00:20:47,517
Here at school?

266
00:20:47,642 --> 00:20:50,853
Yes! I carefully selected a
mixture of herbs with various benefits...

267
00:20:50,937 --> 00:20:54,190
Well, it really made a huge difference.

268
00:20:57,360 --> 00:21:00,571
Just saying, it's going to lead to more
jealousy, which will lead to her being

269
00:21:00,655 --> 00:21:02,407
more isolated.

270
00:21:06,327 --> 00:21:07,620
I don't get it.

271
00:22:27,283 --> 00:22:29,660
He's the only person...

272
00:22:29,744 --> 00:22:31,496
My eyes keep avoiding.

273
00:22:32,914 --> 00:22:35,541
Next time: "The Person That I Like"
